Khisanth Black Dragon~
Khisanth the Black Dragon~
Khisanth the Black Dragon is resting here.
~
Sleek and black, the dragon rises, her glistening wings folded close to
her side, her scales gleaming.  Her eyes glowed red-black, the color of
molten rock.  Her mouth opened in a snarl, teeth flashing white and wicked. 
Her long red tongue curled as she breathed the night air.  The dragon spread
her wings, blotting out stars, obliterating moonlight.  Each wing is tipped
with a pure, white claw that shines in the light of Lunitari.  
~
