Tanis~
Tanis the half-elf~
Tanis, the half-elf stands here, holding on to his sword.
~
The man's body has the thickness and tight muscles of a human, while the facial
hair is definitely humankind.  All you can see of the man's face beneath a
green hood is tan skin and a brownish red beard.  A longbow is slung over one
shoulder and a sword hung at his right side.  He is dressed in soft leather,
carefully tooled in the intricate design the elves loved.  But no elves in the
world of Krynn would grow a beard.    
~
